---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Note | Rainpuddle Website Rescue"
  description="How Rainpuddle LLC handles the details you send through the Website Rescue request form: what we collect, why, and how to ask us to delete it."
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <span class="eyebrow">Privacy note</span>
      <h1>Your details are only used to answer you.</h1>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you send a request, we receive your name, email address, website address, the service you asked
        about, and anything you choose to write in the message box.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use those details to review your website, reply to you, and, if you go ahead, to scope and carry out the
        work. We do not sell or share your details for marketing, and we don’t add you to a mailing list.
      </p>

      <h2>How it reaches us</h2>
      <p>
        The request form is delivered to our inbox by Formspree, a third-party form service that processes your
        message only to deliver it. This website does not use advertising trackers.
      </p>

      <h2>Access to your website</h2>
      <p>
        If you give us access to your website to carry out repairs, we use it only for the agreed work. You can
        remove our access once the project is complete.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions or deletion</h2>
      <p>
        To ask what we hold about you, or to have it deleted, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>
      <p class="prose__meta">{site.company}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .prose__meta {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
